    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote medieval village lived two inseparable pigs \u2014 Piggy and her faithful friend Piggy. They both dreamed of juicy apples hidden in the depths of an old barn. But the path to the coveted treat has become even more difficult: farmers have set new traps, enemies have become more cunning, and completely unusual mechanisms have appeared among the usual blocks that complicate every movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The task seems simple: move the blocks, guide both pigs to the apples, and then help them safely return home to the finish line. However, be prepared for new challenges. Now you have to not only monitor the safety of one pig, but also coordinate the actions of the two characters so that they work as a team. New blocks have appeared, for example, some can collapse when interacting with a certain pig, while others themselves are able to destroy any obstacles on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to build difficult paths so that the pig gets there safely. Protect them from enemies and sharp saws. Don't let them fall down from the platform and don't get crushed by the block you're holding! Remember, you are not able to transfer all the blocks. Some do not move and are an obstacle.\u00a0 Feed the pigs! The pigs want apples!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote medieval village lived two inseparable pigs \u2014 Piggy and her faithful friend Piggy. They both dreamed of juicy apples hidden in the depths of an old barn. But the path to the coveted treat has become even more difficult: farmers have set new traps, enemies have become more cunning, and completely unusual mechanisms have appeared among the usual blocks that complicate every movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The task seems simple: move the blocks, guide both pigs to the apples, and then help them safely return home to the finish line. However, be prepared for new challenges. Now you have to not only monitor the safety of one pig, but also coordinate the actions of the two characters so that they work as a team. New blocks have appeared, for example, some can collapse when interacting with a certain pig, while others themselves are able to destroy any obstacles on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to build difficult paths so that the pig gets there safely. Protect them from enemies and sharp saws. Don't let them fall down from the platform and don't get crushed by the block you're holding! Remember, you are not able to transfer all the blocks. Some do not move and are an obstacle.\u00a0 Feed the pigs! The pigs want apples!</p>",
